---
description: Keep Lunmi H5 and the LunmiBrafer iOS project synchronized
alwaysApply: true
---

After changing `lunmi_h5/src/**`, `static/**`, environment/configuration or build scripts:

1. Run `pnpm sync:ios` in `lunmi_h5`.
2. Run `pnpm check:ios-sync` and resolve any mismatch.
3. Run relevant tests. For native changes, also build the `LunmiBrafer` simulator scheme.

Do not edit generated `LunmiBrafer/LunmiBrafer/Web/**` directly.
H5 builds synchronize automatically. Xcode checks before compiling. Use `pnpm watch:ios` for continuous editing.
Do not claim synchronization succeeded unless the content and source fingerprints match.
